{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-12-08 16:42:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM GROUP INC. DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK , DEC. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE:\xa0OMC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa070 CENTS\xa0PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE CORPORATION'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0JANUARY 11, 2023\xa0TO OMNICOM GROUP COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0DECEMBER 21, 2022."}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-12-08 12:38:00', 'title': "DAVID TURIER PROMOTED TO GENERAL MANAGER OF FLEISHMANHILLARD'S BRUSSELS OFFICE", 'text': "ST. LOUIS , DEC. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FLEISHMANHILLARD\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PROMOTION OF DAVID TURIER, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND SENIOR PARTNER, TO GENERAL MANAGER OF THE AGENCY'S BRUSSELS OFFICE, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. TURIER SUCCEEDS METTE GROLLEMAN WHO IS MOVING AWAY FROM AGENCY LIFE AT THE END OF THE YEAR."}